    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4167" root="تو" body-key="t">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اتوى</span></b> , said of a man, signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَ تَوًّا</span>, i. e.
<i>He came alone; by himself:</i> opposed to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَزْوَى</span>
meaning “ he came with another. ” (T.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See
also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">توى</span>.

